WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.767
-It is so good to see you.
Congrats.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:05.334
The album is finally out,
"Give or Take."

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:06.434
-Finally, yes.

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:07.701
-Finally out.

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:11.200
But last time we saw each other,
we had a good hang.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.834
-Yeah, so, Jimmy and I
actually seen each other

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:15.234
at the past Met Gala.

00:00:15.234 --> 00:00:16.267
-Yeah.

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:18.067
-We were both invited by Chanel,

00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:20.534
so that means, pretty much,
we're at the same table.

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:22.901
I don't know if it's against the
rules to, like, talk too much.

00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:24.067
-No, we can talk about it.

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:26.934
I mean, it was --
We were at the hottest table

00:00:26.934 --> 00:00:29.701
at the biggest fashion night
in the history of the world.

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:32.601
And we were there and we hung
out all night and we bonded.

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:34.767
-So, and it was only my --
I say "only,"

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.400
but it was my second Met Gala.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.801
And I don't want to,
like, tell your age,

00:00:38.801 --> 00:00:41.167
but it was Jimmy's 19th, so...

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:43.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:44.868
-Yeah, it was my 19th.

00:00:44.868 --> 00:00:49.234
But I saw you,
and you looked a little lost,

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:50.701
like a deer in headlights.

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:52.167
-Just like a deer.

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:54.934
But, also, the thing I remember
the most about that night --

00:00:54.934 --> 00:00:56.801
So, we're at our table --

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:59.100
And I'm definitely
not getting invited back,

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.734
because I'm about
to tell all the stories.

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:02.801
-No, we didn't
do anything that bad.

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:05.501
-So, the secret performer
was Lenny Kravitz, right?

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:06.667
-Oh, yeah, he was amazing.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:09.934
-So, Lenny comes out
and starts performing,

00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:11.734
and everyone
is just enjoying it.

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:16.801
And mid-performance, I feel,
like, a tap, and it's Jimmy.

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:19.801
And I'm like, "What, Jimmy?"

00:01:19.801 --> 00:01:21.901
He was like, "Do you want to
know something?"

00:01:21.901 --> 00:01:23.234
I was like, "Right now?"
He was like, "Yeah."

00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:25.033
He was like,
"You know, one time,

00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:28.868
Lenny was doing a performance,
and he a wardrobe malfunction,

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:31.634
and, you know,
everything was out."

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:34.100
And I was like, "Okay."

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.200
And then Jimmy went right back

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.901
to just enjoying
the performance.

00:01:38.901 --> 00:01:41.567
[ Cymbal crash, sad tuba plays ]

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:46.167
And I'm just like, "He actually
ruined the performance for me."

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:48.300
-What are you talking about?
-Now I'm nervous.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.601
I'm like, "What if he rocks out
too hard tonight?"

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:52.634
-No, no,
I think what I was saying is,

00:01:52.634 --> 00:01:54.801
I go, "Did you ever see that
had the wardrobe --"

00:01:54.801 --> 00:01:56.133
He's the one dude
that could have

00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:59.133
a wardrobe malfunction
and he was just cool with it.

00:01:59.133 --> 00:02:00.901
-Yep.
-Because he's Lenny Kravitz.

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:05.267
And his stuff just came out,
and everyone was like,

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:07.133
"Yeah, that's kind of
what we thought," you know?

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:11.000
And he was like,
"Yeah, that's what's up"

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.767
and didn't care,
finished the song, you know?

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.868
Yeah, I don't even if he was,
you know,

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:19.834
strumming with his hand
the second half of the song.

00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:21.501
It was unbelievable.

00:02:21.501 --> 00:02:22.634
And --
[ Cymbal crashes ]

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:26.300
[ Vocalizes
"Are You Gonna Go My Way" ]

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.200
Yeah, hands up.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:31.434
And it -- No, but I'm like,
"That dude is just the coolest."

00:02:31.434 --> 00:02:33.934
Like, he's the sexiest.

00:02:33.934 --> 00:02:35.868
He's just everything you think
Lenny Kravitz.

00:02:35.868 --> 00:02:37.767
If that happened to me,
it would just be

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:39.734
the most embarrassing thing
that ever happened in my life.

00:02:39.734 --> 00:02:42.067
I think I was trying to
say that to you.

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:43.501
-That's definitely what
you were trying to say,

00:02:43.501 --> 00:02:45.467
but I definitely
was scared to watch

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:47.033
the rest of the performance.

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.601
-Come on.
-That's what happened.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:49.934
But it was amazing.

00:02:49.934 --> 00:02:53.701
-We got talking about you got
this album coming out.

00:02:53.701 --> 00:02:56.100
Obviously, we know you have
your first number 1,

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:57.868
with Justin Bieber, "Peaches."

00:02:57.868 --> 00:03:01.834
-Yes, yes.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:01.834 --> 00:03:04.634
-Were you -- Did that --

00:03:04.634 --> 00:03:08.267
-That was pretty crazy,
because not too long ago,

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:09.868
I just was a server
at a restaurant --

00:03:09.868 --> 00:03:11.334
Bubba Gump Shrimp Company.

00:03:11.334 --> 00:03:12.901
-Yeah,
Bubba Gump Shrimp Company.

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:15.167
And -- But that's --
You got to start somewhere.

00:03:15.167 --> 00:03:16.834
And I love that you did that.
-You have to. Yeah.

00:03:16.834 --> 00:03:19.601
-Yeah, and you weren't just
a server, by the way, Giveon.

00:03:19.601 --> 00:03:20.934
-Oh, wow.
-Yeah.

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:23.901
-So, since he's telling
all of my business,

00:03:23.901 --> 00:03:29.067
I was a server, but, also,
every once in a while,

00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:32.167
I would have to get inside
of a shrimp suit.

00:03:32.167 --> 00:03:34.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:39.434
-It made you who you are today.
Come on.

00:03:39.434 --> 00:03:40.968
-It definitely
did make me who I am.

00:03:40.968 --> 00:03:43.400
Actually, I had to
get inside of shrimp suit

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:48.567
and put the head on the shrimp,
the shrimp shoes,

00:03:48.567 --> 00:03:50.801
and, like,
wave everyone in to, like,

00:03:50.801 --> 00:03:52.534
try to convince them
to come eat there.

00:03:52.534 --> 00:03:54.200
-Can you say anything
as the shrimp?

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:57.334
-In the shrimp suit,
you can't speak, right?

00:03:57.334 --> 00:03:59.400
Because shrimp can't talk,
but I'm like,

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.601
"Shrimp don't have, like,
shoes or legs either."

00:04:01.601 --> 00:04:03.033
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:03.033 --> 00:04:05.267
But I asked you --
I go, "Do you mind if --

00:04:05.267 --> 00:04:09.100
There has to be a photo of
you as the shrimp."

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.200
-I tried to
burn, delete, destroy,

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.801
every single picture of me
as the shrimp,

00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:16.100
but, somehow,
you guys got a picture, so...

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.467
-That's Giveon right here,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:04:17.467 --> 00:04:19.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:04:24.267 --> 00:04:25.834
-That's how you know it is me.
I'm just...

00:04:25.834 --> 00:04:29.067
-You're just doing that.
Oh, my gosh.

00:04:29.067 --> 00:04:31.300
But then I was talking to you,

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.501
because I didn't want to
embarrass you,

00:04:32.501 --> 00:04:34.033
but I was talking to you
backstage about this,

00:04:34.033 --> 00:04:37.834
and you go -- You told me about
the one time, did you meet SZA?

00:04:37.834 --> 00:04:41.767
-So, my third interview for
the restaurant --

00:04:41.767 --> 00:04:42.868
Yes, third.

00:04:42.868 --> 00:04:43.901
I don't know why Bubba Gump

00:04:43.901 --> 00:04:45.934
requires three interviews
for some reason.

00:04:45.934 --> 00:04:48.367
-Three interviews. Yeah, yeah.
-So, my third interview --

00:04:48.367 --> 00:04:49.801
-You almost made it, yeah.

00:04:49.801 --> 00:04:50.901
We don't know if
you're shrimp material.

00:04:50.901 --> 00:04:53.200
-I'm just like, "What?"

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:56.133
So, I'm walking
into the third interview

00:04:56.133 --> 00:04:58.000
and I just see SZA walking.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:02.067
And I ambush her like, "Hi."

00:05:02.067 --> 00:05:03.267
-Yeah.

00:05:03.267 --> 00:05:05.033
-Just was
rambling out the words.

00:05:05.033 --> 00:05:06.601
I don't even remember
everything I said,

00:05:06.601 --> 00:05:08.200
but then I said too much.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:11.334
But she was extremely nice.
But I got the job, though.

00:05:11.334 --> 00:05:14.801
-Yeah. But then -- No, but then
this is really what happened.

00:05:14.801 --> 00:05:16.400
But then didn't you
sing for her?

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:19.534
-Okay...
[ Laughter ]

00:05:19.534 --> 00:05:21.934
-You can't jump over the desk.
-Right.

00:05:21.934 --> 00:05:25.100
-But then you --
-Yes, I sang for her, okay?

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:28.067
I was gonna leave that part out.
I sang, and she was just like...

00:05:28.067 --> 00:05:30.534
-Why would you leave it out?
-I don't know. I just --

00:05:30.534 --> 00:05:31.834
-You're a fan.

00:05:31.834 --> 00:05:34.267
-I was a very big fan
and still am.

00:05:34.267 --> 00:05:36.100
I was singing for her,
and she was just like,

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.467
"This guy's singing."

00:05:38.467 --> 00:05:39.901
-You should have done it
in the shrimp costume.

00:05:39.901 --> 00:05:42.567
-I definitely should have,
but you're not allowed to talk.

00:05:42.567 --> 00:05:43.868
-Oh, yeah, that's true.

00:05:43.868 --> 00:05:45.367
Yeah, you got to be
out of character. Yeah, yeah.

00:05:45.367 --> 00:05:47.234
-To to be quiet.
And in the suit, like --

00:05:47.234 --> 00:05:50.367
-Yeah. Have you ever talked to
SZA about this story?

00:05:50.367 --> 00:05:54.834
-So, she came to a show
like years later.

00:05:54.834 --> 00:05:57.801
And I told her, and she was
like, "Oh, I don't remember."

00:05:57.801 --> 00:06:02.734
So, I went on Instagram and
unsent the DM that I sent her.

00:06:02.734 --> 00:06:04.334
-Wait. You DM'ed her
when you were --

00:06:04.334 --> 00:06:06.567
-Absolutely. I was like,
"This is me, remember?

00:06:06.567 --> 00:06:09.234
Please remember."

00:06:09.234 --> 00:06:11.133
And then, at the show, she was
like, "I don't remember."

00:06:11.133 --> 00:06:13.434
I went to the DM,
and it says, "2014.

00:06:13.434 --> 00:06:14.667
Hi. My name is Giveon.

00:06:14.667 --> 00:06:16.133
I was the kid at
Long Beach Bubba Gump.

00:06:16.133 --> 00:06:17.133
Do you remember me?"

00:06:17.133 --> 00:06:19.033
And I --
-Just took it off.

00:06:19.033 --> 00:06:20.534
-I took it off.

00:06:20.534 --> 00:06:23.300
-You're like, "I don't want any
proof of me doing that."

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:24.634
-So if she brings it up,

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:27.834
"I don't know what
you're talking about."

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:29.434
-Let's talk about
"Give or Take."

00:06:29.434 --> 00:06:30.601
-"Give or Take," yes.
-Here we go.

00:06:30.601 --> 00:06:32.634
Is it two years
in the making, at least?

00:06:32.634 --> 00:06:35.601
-So, yeah,
two years in the making.

00:06:35.601 --> 00:06:37.133
-Wow! That's got to feel good
to be out, huh?

00:06:37.133 --> 00:06:38.601
-Yeah. It's a sigh of relief.

00:06:38.601 --> 00:06:41.601
But now I think the work
kind of starts now.

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:42.701
-Yeah.

00:06:42.701 --> 00:06:43.801
-I would hate to just drop it

00:06:43.801 --> 00:06:45.567
and then just
abandon everything.

00:06:45.567 --> 00:06:47.133
-No. No.

00:06:47.133 --> 00:06:48.801
Which song
are you doing tonight?

00:06:48.801 --> 00:06:51.033
-So, tonight, I'm performing
my new song, "Lie Again."

00:06:51.033 --> 00:06:52.234
-"Lie Again."
-Yeah.

00:06:52.234 --> 00:06:55.267
-Yeah. You know,
we saw you the other night.

00:06:55.267 --> 00:06:57.067
I was watching
the BET Awards on Sunday.

00:06:57.067 --> 00:06:59.300
-Oh, my God. You've seen it.
Yeah.

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.934
-Well, I noticed you had an
issue or something with sound...

00:07:01.934 --> 00:07:04.100
-I had a technical difficulty
for sure.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:05.434
-...with your performance.

00:07:05.434 --> 00:07:09.267
And later, you tweeted that
BET sabotaged your mic.

00:07:09.267 --> 00:07:10.400
-Mm-hmm.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:11.834
-And then we heard
that you were joking.

00:07:11.834 --> 00:07:14.000
And I just thought that maybe
if you want to right now --

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.067
to whatever camera you want to,
would you like to, Giveon,

00:07:16.067 --> 00:07:17.467
explain yourself?

00:07:17.467 --> 00:07:20.834
-Oh, my -- Is this the same mic?
I don't know if I trust the mic.

00:07:20.834 --> 00:07:21.901
-You can trust us.

00:07:21.901 --> 00:07:24.734
You can trust us.
Please explain.

00:07:24.734 --> 00:07:29.033
-[ High-pitched ] Yes.
I was joking.

00:07:29.033 --> 00:07:32.067
BET did not sabotage me.

00:07:32.067 --> 00:07:34.434
-Okay. They didn't
sabotage you at all.

00:07:34.434 --> 00:07:35.634
-[ Deeply ] No, no, not at all.

00:07:35.634 --> 00:07:38.934
I'm positive BET supports me

00:07:38.934 --> 00:07:41.133
and would never
purposely alter my voice.

00:07:41.133 --> 00:07:42.367
-That sounds great.

00:07:42.367 --> 00:07:44.601
Well, thank you
for clearing it up, everyone.

00:07:44.601 --> 00:07:47.367
-[ Auto-tuned ] No, of course.
And, anyway...

00:07:47.367 --> 00:07:50.667
♪ I'm happy to be here ♪

00:07:50.667 --> 00:07:54.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:54.434 --> 00:07:59.367
♪ So happy to be here ♪

00:07:59.367 --> 00:08:00.734
And I know I can trust you guys,
so thank you, guys.

00:08:00.734 --> 00:08:01.901
-Giveon, everyone.

00:08:01.901 --> 00:08:04.634
Yeah, we would never do --
We would never.

00:08:04.634 --> 00:08:08.300
Giveon! "Give or Take"
is available now!

